"lines": [
{
"text": "The Sabbath held its breath above the tomb.",
"start": 10.16,
"end": 15.101
},
{
"text": "Below, a light disturbed the dead.",
"start": 17.561,
"end": 21.481
},
{
"text": "Satan came to Hades: \u201cHe died upon the cross.",
"start": 41.702,
"end": 46.382
},
{
"text": "The Nazarene is yours. Prepare His cell.\u201d",
"start": 47.442,
"end": 51.362
},
{
"text": "But Hades shook: \u201cHe called four-day Lazarus;",
"start": 53.322,
"end": 56.802
},
{
"text": "My prisoner flew out at a single word.",
"start": 58.962,
"end": 62.842
},
{
"text": "If Jesus enters, every cell will open.",
"start": 64.342,
"end": 68.803
},
{
"text": "Do not bring Him here. We'll lose them all!\u201d",
"start": 70.303,
"end": 74.883
},
{
"text": "Satan laughed; the chambers shook beneath him.",
"start": 76.103,
"end": 80.303
},
{
"text": "The captives turned toward the growing light.",
"start": 81.863,
"end": 89.443
},
{
"text": "Adam called to Seth: \u201cTell of mercy's oil.\u201d",
"start": 90.603,
"end": 96.164
},
{
"text": "\u201cThe Son will come and heal my father's wound.\u201d",
"start": 97.184,
"end": 100.864
},
{
"text": "Isaiah cried, \u201cI spoke of light in darkness!\u201d",
"start": 102.324,
"end": 107.224
},
{
"text": "John said, \u201cI pointed to the Lamb of God.",
"start": 107.904,
"end": 112.044
},
{
"text": "At Jordan I saw the Spirit rest on Him;",
"start": 114.484,
"end": 118.144
},
{
"text": "I heard the Father call Him His own Son.\u201d",
"start": 119.984,
"end": 124.065
},
{
"text": "David cried, \u201cI sang that brass would break!\u201d",
"start": 125.785,
"end": 129.545
},
{
"text": "Jeremiah said, \u201cGod would walk among us.\u201d",
"start": 131.245,
"end": 135.445
},
{
"text": "The saints broke into praise. Now Satan shook;",
"start": 137.945,
"end": 142.805
},
{
"text": "He searched in vain for any way to flee.",
"start": 142.845,
"end": 147.585
},
{
"text": "Who is this King of Glory?",
"start": 148.685,
"end": 151.526
},
{
"text": "The Lord, the mighty One!",
"start": 152.366,
"end": 154.526
},
{
"text": "Lift up your gates for the King of Glory",
"start": 154.626,
"end": 159.546
},
{
"text": "Let the iron fall before His light",
"start": 160.346,
"end": 163.206
},
{
"text": "Jesus Christ, the deathless Lord",
"start": 163.606,
"end": 166.226
},
{
"text": "Has entered death and broken night",
"start": 166.406,
"end": 170.926
},
{
"text": "By His cross the chains are shattered",
"start": 172.346,
"end": 175.146
},
{
"text": "By His life the dead arise",
"start": 175.246,
"end": 178.007
},
{
"text": "Son of Mary, Son of God",
"start": 178.107,
"end": 180.667
},
{
"text": "The King of Glory reigns on high",
"start": 180.847,
"end": 190.007
},
{
"text": "Hades cried, \u201cBar every gate of brass!",
"start": 190.267,
"end": 193.927
},
{
"text": "Set every bolt across the iron doors!\u201d",
"start": 195.387,
"end": 200.127
},
{
"text": "A thief arrived, his cross upon his back:",
"start": 200.627,
"end": 205.868
},
{
"text": "\u201cI died beside Him. He heard my prayer.",
"start": 207.068,
"end": 211.448
},
{
"text": "He promised me His paradise today;",
"start": 212.908,
"end": 217.088
},
{
"text": "I come before Him. He is close behind.\u201d",
"start": 218.768,
"end": 224.688
},
{
"text": "David cried, \u201cOpen to the King!\u201d",
"start": 224.768,
"end": 229.348
},
{
"text": "The saints rose up; the thunder rolled again.",
"start": 230.208,
"end": 234.989
},
{
"text": "Who is this King of Glory?",
"start": 236.069,
"end": 239.189
},
{
"text": "The Lord, the mighty One!",
"start": 239.669,
"end": 241.809
},
{
"text": "Lift up your gates for the King of Glory",
"start": 241.869,
"end": 246.709
},
{
"text": "Let the iron fall before His light",
"start": 247.629,
"end": 250.469
},
{
"text": "Jesus Christ, the deathless Lord",
"start": 250.869,
"end": 253.349
},
{
"text": "Has entered death and broken night",
"start": 253.609,
"end": 258.189
},
{
"text": "The gates of brass burst outward; iron fell.",
"start": 259.37,
"end": 262.79
},
{
"text": "The King came through in human form and glory.",
"start": 262.97,
"end": 265.73
},
{
"text": "The deepest prison flooded with His light;",
"start": 265.87,
"end": 269.71
},
{
"text": "Satan staggered backward, seeking flight.",
"start": 269.77,
"end": 274.19
},
{
"text": "Christ caught and bound the father of the lie;",
"start": 274.29,
"end": 276.47
},
{
"text": "He gave him over to the keeper of the dead:",
"start": 276.63,
"end": 281.83
},
{
"text": "\u201cHold him until the day I come again.\u201d",
"start": 282.51,
"end": 286.811
},
{
"text": "The jailer held the one who filled his cells.",
"start": 288.371,
"end": 292.951
},
{
"text": "Jesus crossed the ruins, calling Adam:",
"start": 295.171,
"end": 298.671
},
{
"text": "\u201cPeace to you and all your children.\u201d",
"start": 301.151,
"end": 304.911
},
{
"text": "He raised him; Adam knew the hands that made him.",
"start": 306.211,
"end": 309.791
},
{
"text": "Eve fell weeping at her Lord's feet;",
"start": 310.251,
"end": 312.571
},
{
"text": "He raised her; she knew those hands as well.",
"start": 312.851,
"end": 316.352
},
{
"text": "One tree had led them into death;",
"start": 316.532,
"end": 319.312
},
{
"text": "Christ's cross became their road to life.",
"start": 319.332,
"end": 322.172
},
{
"text": "He led the righteous through the broken gates.",
"start": 322.372,
"end": 325.912
},
{
"text": "They asked Him for a sign of victory;",
"start": 325.952,
"end": 330.112
},
{
"text": "He set His cross where death had held its throne.",
"start": 330.512,
"end": 334.272
},
{
"text": "The thief had carried his across the threshold;",
"start": 335.632,
"end": 339.572
},
{
"text": "Now Adam's children followed Christ toward home.",
"start": 341.773,
"end": 361.433
},
{
"text": "Lift up your gates for the King of Glory",
"start": 361.913,
"end": 367.373
},
{
"text": "Let the iron fall before His light",
"start": 367.553,
"end": 373.774
},
{
"text": "Jesus Christ, the deathless Lord",
"start": 374.614,
"end": 377.214
},
{
"text": "Has entered death and broken night",
"start": 377.394,
"end": 380.474
},
{
"text": "By His cross the chains are shattered",
"start": 380.554,
"end": 383.214
},
{
"text": "By His life the dead arise",
"start": 383.394,
"end": 386.274
},
{
"text": "Son of Mary, Son of God",
"start": 386.314,
"end": 389.154
},
{
"text": "The King of Glory reigns on high",
"start": 389.194,
"end": 394.914
},
{
"text": "Christ is risen. Adam rises.",
"start": 396.435,
"end": 399.475
},
{
"text": "Eve comes walking into day.",
"start": 399.835,
"end": 402.695
},
{
"text": "The King of Glory leads His people",
"start": 402.895,
"end": 406.415
},
{
"text": "Out of death and into life.",
"start": 407.975,
"end": 416.455
}
],
